Subject: [PATCH 02/13] infinity6c: import John Chia's backend and SigmaStar
 glue @ 672f8b3

Verbatim from johnchia/raptor-hal (branch sigmastar) at 672f8b3:
src/infinity6c/ (MI 3.0 backend, MI reached by dlopen), src/hal_symbols.h,
src/caps_sigmastar.inc, src/hal_internal_sigmastar.h and mk/sigmastar.mk.
hal_internal_hisilicon.h is a stub that ends the platform chain with the
unknown-platform #error: no HiSilicon backend in this fork.

Not buildable on its own: the shared-file hooks and the upstream-interface
shim follow.
